Modifications in this repository
--------------------------------
The upstream project is a multi-gamemode server network (SkyBlock, BedWars,
SkyWars, Murder Mystery, a prototype lobby, a replay viewer and the services
behind them). This repository changes it as follows:

  - Adds the Ravengard extraction-dungeon game: the type.ravengardgeneric,
    type.ravengardlobby and type.ravengarddungeon modules, the Ravengard
    dungeon generator in the dungeons module, the Ravengard resource pack
    definition in the packer module, the Chinese localisation overlay under
    localization/, and the Ravengard data under configuration/ravengard.
  - Removes everything that Ravengard does not use: all SkyBlock, BedWars,
    SkyWars and Murder Mystery modules, the prototype/main lobby and replay
    viewer, the auction house, bazaar, item tracker, dark auction, election,
    friend, guild, punishment, replay, store and API services, the anticheat,
    spark and pvp modules, the documentation website, the Fabric client mod,
    the installer, the store front end, and the related CI workflows,
    configuration, scripts and Docker services.
  - Trims the shared modules (commons, type.generic, velocity.extension,
    service.generic, service.orchestrator) to what Ravengard needs; ServerType
    now contains only RAVENGARD_LOBBY and RAVENGARD_DUNGEON.
  - Adds the deployment files under deploy/ and rewrites the README.

